{"lang":"en","summary":"Agent 开发工程师面试中，系统设计题是区分初中高级的关键。本专题汇总架构设计相关的面试题和攻略。","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"架构设计题 — 入口导航\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> moc\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"架构设计\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/架构设计\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> meta/moc</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h1 data-heading=\"架构设计题专题\" dir=\"auto\">架构设计题专题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 开发工程师面试中，系统设计题是区分初中高级的关键。本专题汇总架构设计相关的面试题和攻略。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"核心架构知识\" dir=\"auto\">核心架构知识</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/Agent%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E5%88%86%E5%B1%82%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/Agent%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E5%88%86%E5%B1%82%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent架构分层设计</a> — 五层架构设计详解</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A7Agent%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A7Agent%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">生产级Agent设计</a> — 状态机、熔断、降级、监控</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E5%8D%8F%E4%BD%9C%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E5%8D%8F%E4%BD%9C%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体协作模式</a> — 三种协作模式对比</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"架构设计面试题\" dir=\"auto\">架构设计面试题</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"基础架构\" dir=\"auto\">基础架构</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Q13-%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A7%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%9C%BA%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Q13-%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E7%BA%A7%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%9C%BA%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q13-生产级状态机设计</a> — Agent 状态机设计</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"Q04-超时处理与降级策略\" href=\"Q04-超时处理与降级策略\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q04-超时处理与降级策略</a> — 降级策略设计</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/09-%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5/Q08-%E5%AE%B9%E9%94%99%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E4%B8%8E%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/09-%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5/Q08-%E5%AE%B9%E9%94%99%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E4%B8%8E%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q08-容错设计与错误处理</a> — 容错架构</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"系统设计题（重点）\" dir=\"auto\">系统设计题（重点）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/03-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E9%A2%98%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/03-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E9%A2%98%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">系统设计题攻略</a> — 4S答题法则</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/Q18-%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/Q18-%E5%AE%9E%E9%99%85%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q18-实际项目架构设计</a> — MCP + Agent 架构设计</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/09-%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5/Q10-%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/09-%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5/Q10-%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E9%87%8F%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Q10-并发处理与流量控制</a> — 高并发架构</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"经典系统设计题\" dir=\"auto\">经典系统设计题</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"题1：设计一个智能客服Agent系统\" dir=\"auto\">题1：设计一个智能客服Agent系统</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>考点</strong>：RAG、工具调用、多轮对话、人工兜底<br>\n<strong>参考回答结构</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">需求分析：QPS、延迟、准确率要求</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">架构设计：接入层→对话管理→Agent核心→工具层→输出管控</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">核心模块：RAG检索、意图识别、Slot填充</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">运维保障：监控、降级、A/B测试</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 data-heading=\"题2：设计一个多Agent协作的内容生成平台\" dir=\"auto\">题2：设计一个多Agent协作的内容生成平台</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>考点</strong>：多Agent编排、任务分解、质量控制<br>\n<strong>参考回答结构</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">Agent角色定义：Researcher、Writer、Editor、Reviewer</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">协作流程：串行/并行/混合</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">质量保障：多轮审稿、人工终审</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">扩展性：新Agent插拔、流程配置化</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 data-heading=\"题3：设计一个Agent即服务(Agent-as-a-Service)平台\" dir=\"auto\">题3：设计一个Agent即服务(Agent-as-a-Service)平台</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>考点</strong>：多租户、隔离、扩展、计费<br>\n<strong>参考回答结构</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">平台架构：API网关→调度器→Agent运行时→工具市场</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">多租户：Namespace隔离、资源配额</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">工具市场：MCP Server注册发现</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">计费：Token用量、调用次数、增值服务</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"面试攻略\" dir=\"auto\">面试攻略</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/03-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E9%A2%98%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/03-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5/%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E9%A2%98%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">系统设计题攻略</a> — 完整答题框架</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> — 工程实现细节</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关MOC\" dir=\"auto\">相关MOC</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> — 框架选型参考</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a> — 多Agent架构参考</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> — 生产环境考量</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}